id=viwoods_lmkd_tune
name=Viwoods lmkd tune
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=eldenlord
description=Configures lmkd to reduce background kills on the Viwoods AI Paper Reader. Raises ro.lmk.psi_complete_stall_ms to 2000 and vm.watermark_scale_factor to 500 to reduce premature lmkd kills on low-RAM MTK devices.
